  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original whole lightly built biped dotted with numerous small scutes. [\"Holotype has at least304 disarticulated osteoderms, exact life positions unknown. Lowpoly small-scute arrangement is reconstruction not measured original rows.\", \"Photo mount includes restored elements. No claim direct original fossil inspection; original paper figure captions/text read but photo files could not be acquired.\", \"Head incomplete; fleshy outline, skin colours inferred.\", \"NPS narrative permits quadrupedality but2021 primary locomotor analysis supports biped; follow primary and original requested target.\", \"Manual and pedal elements are incomplete/disarticulated. Five small manual digit forms and three principal toes plus reduced medial toe are stylized reconstructions, not a complete articulated specimen. Osteoderm shapes are simplified low-keeled forms rather than replicas of each published morphotype.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 1.2, \"basis\": \"NHM approximate genus length, not a measured reconstruction of one specimen. NPS approximately4feet agrees; UMD1.5m not adopted.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original whole lightly built biped dotted with numerous small scutes. [\"Holotype has at least304 disarticulated osteoderms, exact life positions unknown. Lowpoly small-scute arrangement is reconstruction not measured original rows.\", \"Photo mount includes restored elements. No claim direct original fossil inspection; original paper figure captions/text read but photo files could not be acquired.\", \"Head incomplete; fleshy outline, skin colours inferred.\", \"NPS narrative permits quadrupedality but2021 primary locomotor analysis supports biped; follow primary and original requested target.\", \"Manual and pedal elements are incomplete/disarticulated. Five small manual digit forms and three principal toes plus reduced medial toe are stylized reconstructions, not a complete articulated specimen. Osteoderm shapes are simplified low-keeled forms rather than replicas of each published morphotype.\"] {\"total_length_m\": 1.2, \"basis\": \"NHM approximate genus length, not a measured reconstruction of one specimen. NPS approximately4feet agrees; UMD1.5m not adopted.\"}"
  },
